# Vendored archives are opt-in. Only libchdr and rcheevos — dependencies with
# no system-package fallback, so an offline build could not get them — are
# committed; tools/ci/vendor_deps.sh stages the
# rest here on demand for air-gapped builds, and those must not be committed
# (SDL3 alone is ~15 MB).
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz
*.tar.bz2
*.zip
!libchdr-*.tar.gz
!rcheevos-*.tar.gz
